{#
  BeMart shared ADMIN layout.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `default_frame.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/default_frame.twig).

  The storefront pages extend `base.html.twig` (a port of EC-CUBE's
  default-theme `default_frame.twig`). The admin pages use a DIFFERENT
  layout — EC-CUBE's admin theme has its own frame: a left sidebar
  navigation (`c-mainNavArea`), a top header bar (`c-headerBar`) with the
  logged-in operator's menu, and a `c-contentsArea` content region with
  the page title. This file is the port of that admin frame; every admin
  page does `{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}`.

  Same port standard as `base.html.twig` (see var/templates/README.md,
  "Admin pages" section): keep EC-CUBE's markup skeleton and `c-*` /
  `ec-*` class names verbatim; only the EC-CUBE-runtime bindings are
  rebound.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (documented; see README "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ '...'|trans }}`  -> the Japanese literal the key resolves to in
     messages.ja.yaml. Same rebinding as the storefront port. The static
     chrome labels (ホーム / 情報 / the official-site links / the header
     menu labels) are inlined as ja literals.
   - `asset('x', 'admin'|'bundle')` -> static URL (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
     BeMart has no asset-hash pipeline, but the asset PACKAGE argument is
     KEPT: BeMartTwigExtension::asset() ports EC-CUBE's `assets.packages`
     map (framework.yaml) — `admin` -> `/template/admin/`, `bundle` ->
     `/bundle/`. The admin theme and the default storefront theme ship
     byte-different files at the same `assets/...` path (e.g.
     `assets/js/function.js`); the package keeps them on separate served
     URLs so the deployed `public/` tree resolves each to the right file.
   - `csrf_token(...)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     `<meta eccube-csrf-token>` is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     the inline jQuery `$.ajaxSetup` <script> is OMITTED exactly as
     `base.html.twig` omits it. EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as
     residual in the render-diff tests.
   - `app.user.*` (the logged-in operator), `eccubeNav` / `menus` /
     `active_menus()` (the dynamic admin menu tree + active-section
     state) -> ADMIN auth/menu runtime. BeMart's admin resources are
     authenticated at the resource layer (`AdminSessionInterface`); the
     html context carries no operator entity and no dynamic nav tree, so
     the operator menu and the `eccubeNav` loop are rendered from a
     MINIMAL STUB: the header user-menu shows a fixed operator label and
     the sidebar renders only the static ホーム / 情報 items (EC-CUBE's
     `nav.twig` `{% for %}` over `eccubeNav` is reduced to its two static
     bookend `<li>`s). Enumerated as residual.
   - `@admin/nav.twig`, `@admin/alert.twig`, `@admin/info.twig`,
     `@admin/notice_debug_mode.twig`, `@common/lang.twig`,
     `@admin/snippet.twig` -> EC-CUBE admin includes (the nav tree, flash
     alerts, the EC-CUBE notice strip, the JS i18n bundle, plugin
     snippets). BeMart has no equivalent; the nav is inlined minimally
     (above) and the alert/info/notice/lang/snippet includes are dropped.
     The render-diff test serves them as empty templates so they
     contribute nothing on either side.
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <meta name="eccube-csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token|default('') }}">
    <title>{% if title is defined and title is not empty %}{{ title }} {% endif %}{% if sub_title is defined and sub_title is not empty %}{{ sub_title }} {% endif %}- {{ shop_name|default('BeMart') }}</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ asset('assets/img/favicon.ico', 'admin') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://use.fontawesome.com/releases/v6.5.2/css/all.css" integrity="sha384-PPIZEGYM1v8zp5Py7UjFb79S58UeqCL9pYVnVPURKEqvioPROaVAJKKLzvH2rDnI" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://use.fontawesome.com/releases/v6.5.2/css/v4-shims.css" integrity="sha384-XyvK/kKwgVW+fuRkusfLgfhAMuaxLPSOY8W7wj8tUkf0Nr2WGHniPmpdu+cmPS5n" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/css/bootstrap.css', 'admin') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/css/app.css', 'admin') }}">
    <script src="{{ asset('admin.bundle.js', 'bundle') }}"></script>
    {% block stylesheet %}{% endblock %}
</head>
<body id="page_{{ route|default('admin_homepage') }}">
<header class="c-headerBar">
    <div class="c-headerBar__container">
        <div class="c-headerBar__logo">
            <h1><img src="{{ asset('assets/img/logo@2x.png', 'admin') }}"></h1>
        </div>
        <a class="c-headerBar__toggleBtn"><i class="fa fa-bars" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        <a class="c-headerBar__shopTitle" href="{{ url('homepage') }}" target="_blank"><span>{{ shop_name|default('BeMart') }}</span><i class="fa fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        <a class="c-headerBar__userMenu"
           data-bs-container="body"
           data-bs-toggle="popover"
           data-bs-placement="bottom"
           title="最終ログイン"
           data-bs-html="true"><i class="fa fa-user-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>{{ admin_name|default('管理者') }} 様</span><i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="c-container">
    <div class="c-mainNavArea">
        <nav>
            <ul class="c-mainNavArea__nav">
                <!-- ホーム -->
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle" href="{{ url('admin_homepage') }}">
                        <i class="fa fa-home fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>ホーム</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <!-- EC-CUBE 管理ナビ静的移植 -->
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#nav-product" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-product">
                        <i class="fa fa-cube fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>商品管理</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="nav-product">
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_product') }}"><span>商品一覧</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_product_product_new') }}"><span>商品登録</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_product_class_name') }}"><span>規格管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_product_class_category') }}"><span>規格分類管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_product_category') }}"><span>カテゴリ管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_product_tag') }}"><span>タグ管理</span></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#nav-order" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-order">
                        <i class="fa fa-shopping-cart fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>受注管理</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="nav-order">
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_order') }}"><span>受注一覧</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop_order_status') }}"><span>対応状況管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_order_export_order') }}"><span>受注CSV出力</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_order_export_shipping') }}"><span>出荷CSV出力</span></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#nav-customer" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-customer">
                        <i class="fa fa-users fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>会員管理</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="nav-customer">
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_customer') }}"><span>会員一覧</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_customer_export') }}"><span>会員CSV出力</span></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#nav-content" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-content">
                        <i class="fa fa-file-text-o fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>コンテンツ管理</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="nav-content">
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_news') }}"><span>新着情報管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_page') }}"><span>ページ管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_layout') }}"><span>レイアウト管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_block') }}"><span>ブロック管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_css') }}"><span>CSS管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_js') }}"><span>JavaScript管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_content_cache') }}"><span>キャッシュ管理</span></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#nav-setting" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-setting">
                        <i class="fa fa-cog fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>設定</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="nav-setting">
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop') }}"><span>基本設定</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop_delivery') }}"><span>配送方法設定</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop_payment') }}"><span>支払方法設定</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop_tax') }}"><span>税率設定</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop_csv') }}"><span>CSV出力項目設定</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_member') }}"><span>メンバー管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_authority') }}"><span>権限管理</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_setting_system_security') }}"><span>セキュリティ管理</span></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#nav-store" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-store">
                        <i class="fa fa-plug fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>オーナーズストア</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="nav-store">
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_store_plugin_owners_search_page') }}"><span>プラグイン一覧</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_store_template') }}"><span>テンプレート一覧</span></a></li>
                        <li><a href="{{ url('admin_store_template_install') }}"><span>テンプレートアップロード</span></a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <!-- 情報 -->
                <li class="c-mainNavArea__navItem">
                    <a class="c-mainNavArea__navItemTitle collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#others" aria-expanded="false"
                       aria-controls="others">
                        <i class="fa fa-info-circle fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>情報</span>
                    </a>
                    <ul class="collapse" id="others">
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.ec-cube.net/" target="_blank">
                                <span>公式サイト</span>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://xoo.ps/eccube/" target="_blank">
                                <span>開発コミュニティ</span>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://doc4.ec-cube.net/" target="_blank">
                                <span>ドキュメント</span>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://www.ec-cube.net/product/" target="_blank">
                                <span>管理・運用マニュアル</span>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="c-curtain"></div>
    <div class="c-contentsArea">
        <div class="c-pageTitle">
            <div class="c-pageTitle__titles">
                <h2 class="c-pageTitle__title">{{ title|default('') }}</h2><span class="c-pageTitle__subTitle">{{ sub_title|default('') }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        {% block main %}{% endblock %}

    </div>
</div>
<script src="{{ asset('assets/js/function.js', 'admin') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('assets/js/bemart-unsupported.js') }}"></script>
{% block javascript %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>
